  "notes": "Fixed supply conflict for T8 by making it wait for pad excavation tasks (T2, T3, T4) since its 50 m3 comes from S1 pad spoil. Adjusted bases for T6 and T7 to reflect they haul 100 m3 from S3 grading (500 m2 * 0.2 m = 100 m3). Total road base haul 150 m3 (100 m3 from grading + 50 m3 from pad). Berm fill requires 562.5 m3 but only 382.743 m3 available from pad excavation and road grading; shortfall noted for solver to resolve. All tasks fit within robot batteries and horizon. Zone serialization enforced via after chains. Pad excavation split across three excavators sequentially in Z1. Road (S3) completes before S2 haul starts (T17 after T11). Pad sinter (T14,T15) before berm sinter (T22 after T15). Compaction and sintering evenly shared between two compactors and two printers."
 },
